WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.070
May 2018.

2
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:05.290
An Ebola outbreak is declared
in Équateur Province,

3
00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.690
Democratic Republic of the Congo.

4
00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.470
The first cases are 30 kilometres
from Bikoro's health office.

5
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:16.990
And Bikoro is 280 kilometres by
road from the city of Mbandaka.

6
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:21.490
About 163,000 people live
in Bikoro health zone.

7
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.610
Most health centres have
limited functionality.

8
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.010
So how do you fight a
deadly outbreak out here?

9
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.330
Wait for patients to
reach a city hospital?

10
00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.930
In this mission, you'll follow
one non-governmental organisation,

11
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.310
at national and local level.

12
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:41.810
Then you'll test how forest, distance and
water shaped the fight against the virus.

13
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:46.680
Your mission: find out how to fight an
outbreak in remote rainforest villages.
